   384→            {/* Video player — mounts as soon as displayUri is ready.
   385→                key={displayUri} ensures a fresh player for each new file:// URI.
   386→
   387→                PRIMARY: native ExoPlayerView (TextureView — immune to OEM surface bugs).
   388→                FALLBACK: expo-video VideoPlayerView, used when native module was not
   389→                compiled into the build (ExoPlayerBoundary catches the render error and
   390→                sets nativePlayerFailed=true). */}
